00:10:20.221 --> 00:10:22.378
It wouldn't help me achieve my mission.

00:10:22.378 --> 00:10:23.769
So I think the ultimate thing

00:10:23.769 --> 00:10:25.301
is you being happy with yourself

00:10:25.301 --> 00:10:27.237
you find the self confidence to understand

00:10:27.237 --> 00:10:28.763
this is what you're all about

00:10:28.763 --> 00:10:30.907
then you can be amazing
in every situation.

00:10:30.907 --> 00:10:32.455
Be yourself in every situation,

00:10:32.455 --> 00:10:33.925
and if you can walk into a room like that,

00:10:33.925 --> 00:10:36.382
you'll notice that you walk
in with your chest higher.

00:10:36.382 --> 00:10:37.633
Not because it's a strategy,

00:10:37.633 --> 00:10:38.988
not because you're walkin' in sayin'

00:10:38.988 --> 00:10:40.074
I need to have my chest high,

00:10:40.074 --> 00:10:41.422
I need to, I need to, I need to be,

00:10:41.422 --> 00:10:43.725
you know, I got to, I'm
wearing my power suit,

00:10:43.725 --> 00:10:45.031
this is what I've got on here.

00:10:45.031 --> 00:10:46.439
Not because you're psyching yourself up,

00:10:46.439 --> 00:10:49.715
just because you are
actually self confident.

00:10:49.715 --> 00:10:51.193
That's what people will gravitate to.

00:10:51.193 --> 00:10:52.861
And that's how you make
a great first impression.

00:10:52.861 --> 00:10:55.662
