I'd also love to know what
did you take from this video

00:11:06.420 --> 00:11:08.480
that you will immediately apply somehow

00:11:08.480 --> 00:11:09.981
in your life or your business.

00:11:09.981 --> 00:11:11.704
What did you think about my story

00:11:11.704 --> 00:11:13.019
about making a first impression?

00:11:13.019 --> 00:11:14.766
Do you have something
that you want to share

00:11:14.766 --> 00:11:16.541
that could add to this video and help

00:11:16.541 --> 00:11:18.172
the other members of Believe Nation?

00:11:18.172 --> 00:11:19.362
Leave it down in the comments below,

